      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Resolve technical integration and security approach for MVP.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 109718,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Update on T3: The legacy telephony API is unstable. I've logged the issues in A8. I propose we skip the telephony integration for MVP and focus only on the ticketing system.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 337175,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Agreed. We can't risk the deadline. Let's decide D5: Ticketing integration is in, Telephony is out for now. I'm proceeding with T6 for the Knowledge Base data model.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 6869,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "That works. Regarding security, I've reviewed A4 against the ICT legislation. We need to ensure the search logs in T6 don't store PII. I can help verify the compliance rules.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 377231,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Good catch. I'll update the frontend validation to strip special characters before sending requests. I've also updated A3 to reflect the reduced integration scope.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
