      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Define practical health risk indicators and observation checklists for officers.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've completed a first draft of the 'Health Risk Indicators and Observation Guide' (A2) as part of T2. The goal was to create a simple, actionable list for non-medical staff. I've categorized them into 'Physical Signs' and 'Behavioral Changes'. Feedback is welcome, especially on clarity and practicality. @504576, can you check if this is something you could use on a busy shift? @444619, this will be the basis for the checklist A3 you'll be designing.",
            "mentions": [
              504576,
              444619
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T2",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Thanks @6456. This is excellent. The language is clear. One suggestion: under 'Physical Signs', 'diaphoresis' might be too technical. Can we change it to 'unexplained or heavy sweating'? Also, for the checklist A3, we need a very simple layout. A single A4 page, portrait, with checkboxes and a small section for notes at the bottom. It has to be quick to fill out while standing.",
            "mentions": [
              6456
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "Perfect feedback, thank you. 'Unexplained or heavy sweating' is much better. I'll make that change. The layout suggestion for A3 is also very helpful, that gives @444619 a clear direction for T4.",
            "mentions": [
              444619
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M17",
            "speaker_id": 444619,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "Ok, one page with checkboxes. Should I use a specific font size?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "Just make it readable in low light. Standard size 11 or 12 should be fine. The key is enough space between lines to avoid ticking the wrong box.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "This is great progress. The collaboration here is exactly what we need. @6456, are there any other points in A2 that need discussion before we finalize the list?",
            "mentions": [
              6456
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "No, the feedback from @504576 was the main thing. I've updated the document. I believe the list of indicators is ready for approval.",
            "mentions": [
              504576
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Excellent. Let's formally approve this list of health risk indicators for inclusion in the guide A2. Any objections?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D3"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Approved from my side.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 19315,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Looks good to me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Great, that's D3 confirmed. And for the checklist A3, we'll proceed with the structure @504576 proposed: a single A4 page with clear checkboxes and a notes section. This is our decision for D4.",
            "mentions": [
              504576
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 444619,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "Ok I will start working on that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          }
        ],
        "thread_outcome": {
          "decisions_made": [
            "D3",
