      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Lock down the SOP, logging template, and filing workflow.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, please find the draft 'Health Risk Assessment and Escalation SOP' (A5) and the 'Central Health Monitoring Log Template' (A4). This covers T3 and T5. I've tried to keep it simple and align with the constraints. Please review, especially the escalation steps and the logging fields.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A4",
              "T3",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "I've read the SOP (A5). Section 3, 'Escalation Path', needs a change. It says 'Contact medical services directly'. Our procedure requires us to inform the shift supervisor first, who then coordinates with medical. This is a critical command chain issue. We can't bypass the supervisor.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "warning",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Thank you for catching that. That's a crucial detail. I'll update it immediately to 'Inform Shift Supervisor, who escalates to Medical Services'. This is exactly the kind of feedback we need for compliance, which we'll document in A8 for T11.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8",
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Regarding the log template A4, it looks good. I'd suggest adding a mandatory 'Handover Acknowledged by' signature field for the incoming shift officer. That closes the loop on the communication gap @504576 mentioned in TH1 and ensures accountability.",
            "mentions": [
              504576
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 19315,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Who is supposed to file the logs at the end of the day?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "Good question. The SOP draft specifies that the shift supervisor is responsible for ensuring all logs are collected and filed in the central binder before the end of their shift. I'll make that section heading bolder for clarity.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "I like that suggestion, @6456. I'll add the signature field to A4. With these changes, are we ready to sign off on the escalation steps and responsibilities in the SOP?",
            "mentions": [
              6456
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "With the supervisor included in the escalation, yes, I approve.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "Excellent. D5 is confirmed. And for the log A4, we agree on the final format including the handover signature, with the supervisor responsible for the central filing routine. That confirms D6.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 19315,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "Ok, I understand now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          }
        ],
        "thread_outcome": {
          "decisions_made": [
            "D5",
            "D6"
          ],
          "next_steps": [
            {
              "task_id": "T6",
              "owner_id": 6456,
              "when": "this week"
