      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Plan and execute the pilot, then consolidate feedback and improvements.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, it's time to plan the pilot. I've drafted the 'Pilot Implementation Plan' (A6) for T7. I'm proposing we run it in Unit C-Block for one full rota cycle, starting next Monday. This unit has a good mix of cases. What are your thoughts?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "C-Block is the right choice. However, next Monday is a major staff rotation day. It would be better to start on Wednesday to give the new shift team a couple of days to settle in. That will give us more reliable feedback on the protocol itself, not on general orientation confusion.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "An excellent point, I hadn't considered the rotation schedule. Starting Wednesday makes perfect sense. Let's lock that in. I'll update A6 and send out the briefing invites. This confirms our decision for the pilot unit, dates, and staff (D7).",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Hi all, fast-forwarding... the pilot is now complete. A huge thank you to everyone in C-Block for their participation. @504576 has consolidated all the feedback from T8 into the 'Pilot Feedback Report' (A7). Please review it when you can.",
            "mentions": [
              504576
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8",
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "The summary is in A7. Key takeaways: the checklist (A3) was well-received for its simplicity. The main issue was the log (A4) - officers felt they needed more space for free-text notes when a situation was complex. Also, a few officers asked for a pocket-sized card with the key risk indicators for quick reference.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "A3",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "The pocket card is a great idea. We can easily create that from the training materials for T10. For the log, expanding the notes section is a simple but important fix. It shows we're adapting the tools to fit the workflow, not the other way around.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 444619,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "So I need to change the log form? How much bigger should the notes section be?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Let's double the size of the notes section. We can reduce the margins or the header size to make space. I can sketch a suggestion for you.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 19315,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "So is the project finished now?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Not quite. We need to implement the changes from the pilot feedback. Based on the report A7 and this discussion, let's agree on the changes to apply before a wider rollout: 1. Expand the notes section in A4. 2. Create a pocket reference card with key indicators. Are we all in agreement on these changes?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 504576,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Yes, those are the critical improvements. Agreed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 6456,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Agreed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 297089,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Perfect, D8 is confirmed. This gives us clear actions for the final tasks. @444619, please proceed with the form updates for T9. @6456, can you incorporate the pocket card into the T10 training materials? I will start drafting the final summary and recommendation for T12.",
            "mentions": [
              444619,
              6456
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9",
              "T10",
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
