            "speaker_id": 64810,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi @93001, I've reviewed the early creative mockups you sent over. We have a few potential production issues. I've detailed them in the draft A3 Creative and Print Specification Guide. The main concern is the use of full-bleed photos with text overlayed near the edge. This is risky for trimming.",
