            "speaker_id": 492953,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, welcome to the official channel for our Food Waste Reduction Program. The goal is to improve margins without impacting guest satisfaction. Let's use this first thread to align on our core targets and select the pilot units. Our 30-day timeline is ambitious, so let's move quickly. Please review the project brief.",
