            "speaker_id": 412987,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for kicking this off. I've reviewed the brief. For pilot units (T8), I suggest we choose one high-volume downtown location and one suburban location with a different menu mix. This will give us a better data set. I can pull guest satisfaction scores for the top 5 candidates by EOD.",
