            "speaker_id": 332110,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good criteria. I'd add supplier proximity. The 'Metro Center' and 'Westwood Village' units share our top 3 perishable goods suppliers. Piloting there would make it easier to test purchasing changes (T4) and negotiate delivery flexibility (T5).",
            "mentions": [],
