          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 492953,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Good question. For the target (T1), I propose we aim for a 15% reduction in food waste by weight in the pilot units over the 30-day period. Does that sound achievable but ambitious enough?",
            "mentions": [
              61317,
              66412,
              332110,
              412987
