            "text": "15% is aggressive but feasible if we get the new tracking and sales behaviors right. We'll need to track this against revenue per guest to ensure we're not just selling less. This should be a key metric in the A1 tracker and the A7 dashboard.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
