            "speaker_id": 332110,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "I agree with 15%. From a purchasing standpoint, if we can tighten up ordering on the top 5 most wasted items, we could hit 10% from that alone. The other 5% can come from operational and sales improvements.",
