            "text": "Alright, with the event spec locked, let's finalize the architecture. I've created a draft design doc in A3. It proposes a standard batch processing architecture using our existing cloud services. For the MVP, I suggest we stick to a daily refresh frequency to keep things simple and reliable. Please share your feedback.",
