          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 447210,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, as we close the first month of Q3, I've compiled the initial performance data. The draft report `A8` is available for review. The good news is that opportunity creation is up 25%, well ahead of target. However, our cross-sell conversion rate is lagging. You can see the details in our dashboard `A3`.",
