            "speaker_id": 231,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. This matches the anecdotal feedback I'm getting. The team finds it easy to identify the opportunities, but they're struggling to build a strong value proposition for some of the product pairings, leading to stalls in the pipeline.",
            "mentions": [
              447210
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 468837,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Exactly. Specifically, the messaging for selling our Analytics Suite to customers who only have the Core Platform is weak. Reps are getting stuck on the 'why now' question. We need better talk tracks and objection handling for that specific scenario.",
            "mentions": [
              231
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
