          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Excellent. So, next steps: @436982 you'll update the SOP template in A2 and set up the risk register A6 with the RPN structure. I'll start scheduling the reviews with Compliance for the first SOPs.",
