        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've completed the draft for the training curriculum and delivery guide (A4) as part of T6. It outlines the asynchronous modules and learning objectives. The document also includes a proposal for the pilot site to test our approach before the full rollout (related to T7). Feedback is welcome.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T6",
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "Thanks @436982, this is a critical piece. I'm reviewing A4 now.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "The curriculum content looks great and covers all the new SOPs. I'm looking at the proposed schedule for T9 - you've allocated two weeks for all staff to complete the training. Given the different shift patterns across sites, do you think that's enough time?",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "That's a valid point. The two-week window is for the self-paced modules. To support this, I've also planned to run optional, live Q&A sessions with supervisors each week. We can also monitor completion rates daily and have managers follow up directly with anyone falling behind. This should provide the flexibility and support needed.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Okay, the combination of self-paced learning with live support and active tracking sounds robust. I'm comfortable with that approach. Shall we formally approve the training curriculum and high-level schedule as laid out in A4?",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Yes, I'm ready for approval on my end. I can then start building out the final training materials.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Great, D8 is approved. Now, let's discuss the pilot for T7. You've proposed Site B. Can you share your reasoning?",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "I chose Site B because their operational profile includes a good mix of the high-risk processes we've standardized. Also, their site supervisor has been highly engaged in this initiative from the start, so I expect we'll get high-quality, constructive feedback from their team, which we can log in A7.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "An engaged local champion is a huge advantage. I agree with the choice. What would we define as the success criteria for this pilot?",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "I'd propose three clear criteria: 1. At least 95% of the pilot team completes the training before go-live. 2. No P1 or P2 operational incidents related to the new processes in the first week. 3. We capture a minimum of 10 actionable feedback items in the A7 feedback log.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Those are clear, measurable, and directly tied to our project goals. I fully support them. Let's make it official.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Decision D7: We will select Site B for the pilot rollout, and we will measure its success based on the three criteria just defined (95% training completion, no major incidents, 10+ feedback items). Are we agreed?",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "Yes, agreed.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "Fantastic. D7 and D8 are locked. I will communicate with the Site B leadership to formalize the pilot plan for T7. @436982 you can proceed with building the final training content for T6 and preparing for the broader rollout in T9.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
