          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M66",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M65",
            "text": "Okay, looking at the full improvement backlog in A8, let's agree on priorities. I propose we prioritize items related to documentation clarity and data accuracy first. That would include the three items we just discussed.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M66",
            "text": "I agree. Those will have the biggest impact on sustaining the improvements. Items like 'adding new optional fields to forms' can wait for the next cycle.",
            "mentions": [
              4315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 4315,
            "reply_to": "M67",
            "text": "Perfect. So, to summarize the next steps from T11: our top priority improvements are fixing the broken links, updating the A5 checklist, and adding KPI definitions to the T12 guide. I will formalize this priority list in A8.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A8",
              "T11",
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "Sounds good. I can take ownership of getting those three actions completed.",
            "mentions": [
