            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 429831,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, we've completed the one-week dry run (T10). From the operational side, things went mostly to plan. We had one issue where a batch of surplus bread was already stale on collection, which I've logged in A7. Packing took about 15 minutes longer than expected for the first batch.",
