            "speaker_id": 516425,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Thanks for the summary. On the delivery side, the new labelling system worked perfectly. The routes were okay, but one street was closed, causing a 20-minute delay. I've also logged this in A7. The doorstep interactions felt good; the script was easy to use. Most people were just happy to get the parcel and didn't want to chat long.",
