            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 73292,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks. The biggest issue is definitely the single queue. We have customers waiting 15 minutes for a simple cash withdrawal behind someone opening a new account. It clogs everything up. For T1, we absolutely need to track transaction types vs. time taken. That's the core problem.",
            "mentions": [],
