        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 455770,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, we've completed the first week of the pilot. I've compiled the initial data into the performance dashboard template A6 and summarized the staff feedback from T8. Please take a look. Key takeaway: overall wait times are down by 15%, but we're seeing a bottleneck in the 'complex service' queue.",
