            "text": "Great, we have alignment. Let's formalize the decisions. \n1. The layout in A3 is approved pending the revision of personnel flow and hygiene zoning. (D1)\n2. We will use epoxy flooring and insulated metal panels for high-hygiene areas. (D2)",
