            "text": "Thanks. I'm looking at the installation sequence. It lists the conveyor first, but based on our layout, shouldn't we install the press first since it's in the corner?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 557389,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "I've reviewed A2. The maintenance tasks in T6 are a good start, but they're missing weekly checks on pneumatic pressure and filter cleaning. Also, for the installation, we need to add a step to verify power phasing for the press motor before the test run. Doing it in the wrong order could damage the motor.",
