            "speaker_id": 416835,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've created the initial Equipment Relocation and Downtime Plan A7. It outlines the sequence for T10 and material staging for T5. The plan assumes we start the move next Friday afternoon to minimize production impact. Please review.",
            "mentions": [
              558542,
              557389,
              55482
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "T10",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 55482,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "Friday works for me. We can get it done quickly.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 557389,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "There's a problem with Friday. The final electrical inspection for the new power drops in the cell area isn't scheduled until Monday morning. If we move the equipment on Friday, it will sit disconnected all weekend, and we won't be able to power it up for testing until Monday anyway. This introduces risk.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 416835,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "That's a critical dependency. Thanks for catching it. In that case, I'll revise A7 to schedule the move for Monday at 8:00 AM, immediately following the electrical sign-off. This ensures we can move and reconnect in a single, coordinated effort.",
            "mentions": [
              557389
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 558542,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "That sounds much safer. Let's clarify responsibilities. @416835, you'll manage the physical move. Who will be responsible for the safe disconnection and reconnection of all utilities?",
            "mentions": [
              416835,
              557389,
              55482
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
