      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Review pilot run results and decide on go-live readiness.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 558542,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Morning team. We've completed the first pilot run as part of T11. I've logged the results in the Pilot Run Performance Log A5. Key takeaways: cycle time is about 15% higher than our target, and we had a few minor soldering defects.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T11",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 89646,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "I noticed the new soldering iron's tip is a different shape than the old one. It felt a bit harder to get a clean joint. Maybe that's related to the defects.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 49338,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "I also felt like I was losing time at the mechanical station. The bin with the small screws is on the left, but I need them for the right side of the assembly. It's a bit of an awkward reach every time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 55482,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "We can just increase the conveyor speed a little to make up the cycle time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 557389,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Increasing speed won't fix the root causes and will likely increase defects. We need to address the issues raised. For the soldering iron, I'll check its temperature calibration and see if we have an alternative tip shape. For the parts bin, that's an easy ergonomic fix we should do immediately.",
            "mentions": [
              89646,
              49338
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 558542,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "I agree completely. Let's focus on fixing the process, not forcing the speed. How was the training, by the way? Did everyone feel prepared? I'm looking at the notes in A8.",
            "mentions": [
              89646,
              49338
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 89646,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "A quick refresher on the new iron's settings would be helpful.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 558542,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Okay, here is the plan: 1. @557389 will check the soldering iron and help @49338 reposition the parts bin. 2. We'll do a quick 15-min retraining on the iron for @89646. 3. We will run a second, smaller pilot batch tomorrow morning to verify our fixes.",
            "mentions": [
              557389,
              49338,
              89646
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 557389,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Sounds like a solid plan. I'll start filling out the Go-Live Readiness Checklist A6 now, and I'll update it with the results of the second pilot. That will feed into the final report for T12.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 558542,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Perfect. So, the decision is clear: we will not proceed with a full go-live today. We will run another pilot tomorrow after implementing these adjustments.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
