            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "clipboard",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 438229,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Thanks! The checklist A4 looks straightforward. Who will be responsible for completing this each day? And where do we store the completed forms?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 437517,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "My proposal is that the shift lead for the front-desk completes it at the end of their shift. It should take less than 5 minutes. We can store them in a shared digital folder. I think a minimum compliance score of 90% is a reasonable target to start.",
            "mentions": [
              438229
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 189450,
            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "That sounds workable. Assigning it to the shift lead makes sense. The checklist A4 covers all the key steps. I have no objections.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
