            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 437517,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "No, this particular checklist is for the admin side of the check-in process. However, nurses and other staff should be using the incident log A6 whenever they spot an issue or have an idea for improvement. It's meant to be a simple way for anyone to flag things.",
            "mentions": [
