            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M11",
            "text": "Thanks for putting this together. For the events, we need more than just general 'event support'. We should have distinct roles: 'Greeters' to welcome people, 'Facilitators' for specific activities, and 'Floaters' to handle logistics. I think we need at least 6 volunteers per event, 2 for each role, to ensure good coverage and prevent burnout.",
            "mentions": [
              58895
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 523420,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "That's a good point on role clarity. Six volunteers per event sounds right. @58895, can we handle recruiting 18+ volunteers in this short timeframe? We should also consider having a 'Team Lead' volunteer role for those with more experience.",
            "mentions": [
              58895,
              76651
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
