            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "Recruiting that many will be a challenge but doable if we start now. I'll prioritize it. I like the idea of a Team Lead. So, to confirm, we're aiming for 1 Team Lead + 5 volunteers for each of the three events? That's 18 total. I'll update A2.",
