            "speaker_id": 83011,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, welcome to the official channel for the Hybrid Customer Onboarding Workspace Rollout project. The main goal is to standardize our onboarding process for all customers. I've attached the initial project brief. Let's use this thread to align on scope and how we'll measure success. First up, I'll be tackling the process mapping in T1.",
