            "speaker_id": 95041,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Agreed on the scope boundary. That clarity prevents scope creep. For success metrics, beyond cycle time, we should consider qualitative feedback from the pilot team. A fast but frustrating process isn't a win. This will inform the final version of A1.",
