            "text": "Team, good news. Legal has approved the templates with minor changes, which have been incorporated. We are clear to proceed with the pilot (T10). I've spoken with sales, and they've proposed 'Innovate Corp' as the first customer. They are a mid-sized, tech-savvy client which should make them a good candidate. What are your thoughts?",
