            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 83011,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, the pilot onboarding with Innovate Corp is complete. I've just shared the Pilot Summary Report (A7) and an updated snapshot of the KPI Tracking Sheet (A4). Please review them and share your thoughts so we can decide on the next steps.",
