          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 119847,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Reading through the report now. It's great to see the cycle time was reduced by 15%! That's a solid win. The feedback about the welcome email being too dense seems to have come up again, though.",
