            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 14637,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "The KPI sheet A4 was straightforward to fill out. One piece of feedback was that the project team wasn't sure when to update their checklist items. Maybe we need to add a reminder step in the workflow.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 95041,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "The cycle time is a good result. The core issue from the report seems to be information overload at the start. Instead of just shortening the email, let's restructure it. We can have a brief welcome with the top 3 things the client needs to know, and then link out to a 'Detailed Onboarding Guide' page with the rest of the information. This addresses the feedback without losing important content.",
            "mentions": [
              119847,
              98050
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 83011,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "That's a much more elegant solution. It empowers the client to dig in as needed. Let's agree on that as a key change. Any other major adjustments needed based on the pilot?",
            "mentions": [
              95041
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 387705,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "No other major issues from my read of A7. The process held up well. The proposed change to the email sounds perfect.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 83011,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Okay, let's make it official. D9: We agree on two key changes based on pilot learnings: 1. Restructure the welcome email to be a summary with a link to a detailed guide, and 2. Add a weekly 'checklist review' task for PMs in the workflow. I'll handle these updates in T11.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D9"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 2
