          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 83011,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "With these changes, the process looks ready for a wider audience. I propose we move forward with a phased rollout to all new customers starting the first of next month. This gives us time to implement the changes from T11. Any objections?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 95041,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "A phased rollout is wise. It allows us to handle any team-specific questions without a big-bang disruption. The timeline is reasonable. I support this.",
