            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's kick off the Integrated Early Support Programme. To start, could everyone briefly share how their teams currently identify and refer at-risk children? This will help us map everything out for T1 and build the Current Procedures Mapping Document (A1).",
            "mentions": [
