            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "Great. I've updated the protocol A2 with the two-stage consent model. The link is unchanged. If there are no other major comments, can we approve it for the pilot?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "The revised consent section in A2 is much better. I'm happy to approve this version.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
