          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Thanks for putting this together. I've had a look at A5. The information is all there, but the tone feels a bit clinical. For example, it says 'This initiative will implement a multi-agency framework to monitor developmental indicators'. For parents, we might want something warmer, like 'We're starting a new programme where teachers and community workers team up to support your child's wellbeing'.",
