            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "I agree. I can help with a rewrite. We need to emphasize partnership and support. I'll make some suggested edits directly in the A5 document for everyone to see.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "writing_hand",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 427511,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Ok.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "While we're on this topic, we also need to define the criteria for home visits as part of T5. I suggest a visit is recommended only when there are persistent concerns that can't be addressed in school, or when the family is facing significant barriers to engaging with the school.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "That sounds like a sensible threshold. It keeps visits for when they are most needed. We must also be explicit about safety rules, like ensuring two staff members are present for initial visits or that a manager is always aware of the visit schedule. Standard lone working policies must apply.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Absolutely. I'll add a section on safety procedures to the T5 documentation, referencing our organisation's existing guidelines. So, the criteria are: 1. Persistent, unresolved concerns, 2. Significant barriers to school engagement, 3. Family requests a home-based meeting.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
