            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Morning all. I've drafted the new standard procedures for the pilot. Please review and provide feedback:\n- A2: Standard Loading and Movement Sequence Guide\n- A4: Shelf Replenishment Routine for Pilot Aisle\nLet's try to finalize these today so we can get them approved.",
