            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 36271,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "Looking at A2, the sequence for loading trolleys seems a bit off. It says to put heavy items at the bottom, which is right, but it doesn't mention anything about centering the weight on the pallet or trolley. If we load one side heavier, it can tip over when we're moving it. We should add a step to balance the load.",
