          {
            "msg_id": "M62",
            "speaker_id": 85956,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, the Eco-Finance week is a wrap! A huge thanks to everyone for your hard work. I've compiled the initial numbers from our Attendance and Engagement Tracker (A6). Overall, we had 150+ attendees across all sessions. I'm starting to work on the final report (T12) using the A8 template. Would love to hear your key observations.",
            "mentions": [],
