            "text": "This is fantastic data. Thanks for sharing. Based on the feedback, here are a few insights I'm seeing:\n1. High engagement with practical, hands-on demos (postal, bakery).\n2. Strong interest in tangible products (sourdough!).\n3. Need to better forecast session attendance to book appropriate room sizes.\nHow do these sound for our key takeaways?",
